<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Tune-Up</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Normal meal ~2h before. One bottle, 40-50g carbs. Done.

MAIN SET:
- 24min @ 65% FTP (Z2, RPE 3)
- 2 x (0:18 @ 140% FTP (Z5+, RPE 8-9) + 2:30 @ 55% FTP (Z2, RPE 3))
- 0:18 @ 140% FTP (Z5+, RPE 8-9)
- 5min @ 50% FTP (Z1, RPE 3)
-Cadence: 95-105rpm on efforts
-Position: Seated, relaxed

PROGRESSION:
-Level 1/6: Introductory - Focus on form and learning the workout pattern
-Short alactic openers -- three brief near-max efforts to wake up neuromuscular firing without creating fatigue

EXECUTION:
-Short sharp efforts to keep the legs remembering speed. Don't dig deep - this should feel like play, not training.</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <SteadyState Duration="1440" Power="0.65" CadenceLow="95" CadenceHigh="105">
      <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Easy warmup for openers" />
    </SteadyState>
    <SteadyState Duration="18" Power="1.40" CadenceLow="95" CadenceHigh="105">
      <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Opener 1 of 3" />
    </SteadyState>
    <SteadyState Duration="150" Power="0.55" CadenceLow="95" CadenceHigh="105" />
    <SteadyState Duration="18" Power="1.40" CadenceLow="95" CadenceHigh="105" />
    <SteadyState Duration="150" Power="0.55" CadenceLow="95" CadenceHigh="105" />
    <SteadyState Duration="18" Power="1.40" CadenceLow="95" CadenceHigh="105" />
    <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.50" CadenceLow="95" CadenceHigh="105">
      <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Spin out" />
    </SteadyState>
  </workout>
</workout_file>